-    // ---- (PS4 04.17) Persistent code cache --------------------------------------------------
-    // The whole code image (the blocks, their cold code, the constants they placed) is saved with
-    // what dynarmic keeps about it, and put back at the same addresses in a later run: same
-    // build, same configuration, the code cache at the same address. Pointers in the code into
-    // objects that move between runs (this JIT, the callbacks, the monitor, the coprocessors and
-    // what Eden lists in code_cache_objects) are found by scanning the code at save time and set
-    // to where those objects are when it loads. Every link between blocks is undone at load; a
-    // saved block is registered when first looked up, if its guest code (its range and the code
-    // its flags look-ahead read) hashes as it did, and links are made again as blocks register.
